# Multiblock Tooltips
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.machine_type=Modular Pressure Tube Reactor (MPTR)
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc1=Modular nuclear reactor simulating discrete neutron transport and moderation
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc2=Supports self-stabilizing negative temperature reactivity feedback
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc3=Height is fixed at 5 blocks for all tiers (octagonal prism chamber)
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc4=Core chamber features cut-corner null cells with reflecting/absorbing casing walls
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc5=Wall heat dissipation is uniformly distributed to all active cells via coolant pool
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc6=Item pipe casings determine operating temperature and allowed coolants:
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc7= - Electrum: IC2 coolant (sub-boiling conductive cooling, max 1000 °C)
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc8= - Platinum: distilled water (sub-boiling conductive cooling, max 1400 °C)
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc9= - Osmium: external coolant loops via HP passage hatches (max 1800 °C)
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc10= - Quantium: heavy water (sub-boiling conductive cooling, max 2200 °C)
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc11= - Fluxed Electrum: external coolant loops with heavy water (max 2600 °C)
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc12= - Black Plutonium: all coolants and loop configurations (max 3200 °C)
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc13=Accepts dynamo and multi-amp dynamo hatches for direct radiovoltaic EU output
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc14= - Radiovoltaic cells convert absorbed neutron flux directly to EU (HV 2A, EV 2A)
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc15=Outputs (depleted items, byproducts, molten cheese) eject to output buses and hatches
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc16=Warning: fluid hatches only support sub-boiling cooling (boiling causes explosion)!
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc17=Warning: overheating hatches void contents!
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc18=Warning: HP coolant passage hatches require Tier 2+ and 1:1 top/bottom pairing!
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc19=Note: This multiblock cannot share walls!
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc20=Top-layer hatches must face up; bottom-layer hatches must face down
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.finisher=GregTech nuclear power

